@startuml
' UC14.1 - Xem chi tiết Course
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx, UC14.1 row.
' BR: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx, BR-49/51/52/53/54/55/79.
' Requested DOCX files are under docs/uml/docs, not directly under docs.
' Both metadata revisions are 1; no identified business-spec release is matched to a snapshot.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent; docs/architecture/source-of-truth-migration-plan.md:184 supports ownership.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.detail.tsx:64 (fetchCourse), :93 (effect).
' UI fields/format: same file:44 (formatEstimatedDuration), :163/:173/:188-216.
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:357/:359/:377 (Instructor route protection and Course detail).
' API: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:94 (fetchCourseDetailAPI); :1 uses courseAxios.
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47/:61/:64; frontend/src/config/env.ts:13.
' Local development URL: frontend/.env.development:10 = http://localhost:8080.
' No local override file was found; process VITE_COURSE_BACKEND_URL is unset.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:2/:40-43.
' Trusted claims: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:133.
' Bootstrap: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40-43 (api prefix, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:125 (findDetail).
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:534 (findDetail), :574 (duration).
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:279 (findDetail),
' :320 (getReadingSpeedWordsPerMinute), :329 (calculateEstimatedDurationMinutes).
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18/:31/:104/:126/:187.
' DB adapter: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10;
' services/course-service/.env:2 selects course_db; credentials are not included here.
' Storage selection: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/storage/storage.provider.ts:31.
' All three required Cloudinary settings are nonempty in local Course .env; no process override found.
' Provider: libraries/ts-storage/src/providers/cloudinary/cloudinary.provider.ts:91 (getUrl).
' It formats a URL with cloudinary.url; it does not make a provider HTTP request.

actor Instructor
boundary "Course Detail Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
participant ":CloudinaryStorageProvider" as Storage
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' Preconditions: authenticated Instructor and valid route Course ID.
' Missing route ID is handled in the UI; invalid UUID is rejected by ParseUUIDPipe (400).
' JWT/internal-key middleware and token refresh are outside the main UC interaction.
' Diagram follows the local development configuration; live requests/other build modes are unverified.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open /instructor/courses/{courseId}
activate Screen
Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}\nTrusted user context
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: Load Course details
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and organization context
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Access checked successfully
  Service -> Repository: Find Course by tenant and chain owner
  activate Repository
  ' where: Course.id, organizationId and chain.instructorId == user.userId.
  ' Selects the displayed metadata, lockedAt and cover-file status/key; no status/Locked restriction.
  Repository -> CourseDB: Read owned Course and cover metadata
  activate CourseDB
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Course details or no match
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: Course details or no match
  deactivate Repository

  alt Course found successfully
    ' Actual private service method; keep this nested execution through its repository work.
    Service -> Service: Calculate estimated duration
    activate Service
    Service -> Repository: Load latest reading speed
    activate Repository
    ' Local platform_settings snapshot, ordered by sourceAsOf descending, without a Tenant REST call.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read latest reading-speed setting
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Reading speed or no setting
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Reading speed or null
    deactivate Repository

    opt Reading speed is positive
      Service -> Repository: Calculate required learning minutes
      activate Repository
      ' Live SQL calculation, not a stored estimated-duration field:
      ' SUM(CEIL(Video.durationSeconds / 60.0)) + SUM(CEIL(Reading.wordCount / readingSpeed))
      ' + Course.assignmentMinutes. Each required Material is rounded before summation.
      ' Excludes disabled Lessons, disabled Materials and isRequired=false Materials.
      ' Restricts Course ID and organizationId; CASE includes Video/Reading only, not Quiz.
      ' durationSeconds/wordCount are stored MediaFile metadata; no extraction runs during this GET.
      Repository -> CourseDB: Sum required Video and Reading minutes\nAdd stored Assignment minutes
      activate CourseDB
      CourseDB -->> Repository: Estimated minutes or no result
      deactivate CourseDB
      Repository -->> Service: Estimated minutes or null
      deactivate Repository
    end
    ' Missing/nonpositive reading speed returns null without executing the aggregate SQL.
    ' This suppresses the whole estimate, including otherwise known Video/Assignment minutes.
    ' A valid empty Course can instead total zero minutes; no aggregate row also returns null.
    deactivate Service

    opt Cover is Ready and not released
      Service -> Storage: Build cover image URL
      activate Storage
      Storage -->> Service: Cover URL
      deactivate Storage
    end
    ' Otherwise coverUrl=null. No upload, presigning or backend Cloudinary network request occurs.
    ' Optional browser image loading from the returned URL is outside this business trace.
    ' locked is derived from lockedAt != null; Submitted is not treated as Locked by this response.
    Service -->> Controller: Course details, duration and locked state
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nCourse details
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Course details
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show Course metadata and duration\nDays, type, status and lock state
  else Course lookup failed
    ' Restore incoming executions for this alternative; actor/screen remain active.
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' Missing Course, wrong tenant and wrong chain owner all produce the same scoped no-match result.
    ' No duration/settings query or cover URL processing occurs after this rejection.
    Service -->> Controller: Course not found (404)
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 404 Not Found
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Detail load error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Course not found"\nOffer Back to My Courses
  end
else Access check failed
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' Non-INSTRUCTOR or missing organizationId -> 403 before any repository call.
  Service -->> Controller: Access denied (403)
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Detail load error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Course not found"\nOffer Back to My Courses
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' BR-49/79: displayed Course fields are real data, limited to the current tenant and chain owner.
' Missing objectives/outcomes use UI placeholders; they do not prevent viewing an owned Draft.
' Locked/Submitted do not deny reading. No edit, Builder, material or approval action is executed here.
' BR-51/52: required Video/Reading only; Quiz time and Lesson introductory content contribute nothing.
' Assignment minutes are a stored absolute total; no per-Assignment read or Assessment REST occurs here.
' Upstream evidence (not part of this GET):
' services/assessment-service/src/modules/assessments/assessments.service.ts:143/:158/:416/:485
' invokes syncAssignmentMinutes after Assignment create/duration-update/delete commits.
' Its repository sumExpectedMinutes (:121 in assessments.repository.ts) sums expectedDurationMinutes
' for organizationId/courseId/kind=ASSIGNMENT; every Assignment is included, no optional flag filter.
' HttpCourseServiceClient.setAssignmentMinutes (:141 in infrastructure/clients/course/http-course-service.client.ts)
' sends POST /api/v1/internal/courses/{courseId}/assignment-minutes with the absolute total.
' services/assessment-service/.env:11 selects COURSE_CLIENT_MODE=http; the factory defaults to HTTP.
' Receiver: services/course-service/src/modules/internal-courses/internal-courses.controller.ts:64;
' internal-courses.service.ts:131 updates assignment_minutes and its timestamp for the organization.
' Failed upstream sync is caught/logged; Assignment stays committed and the local minutes may be stale.
' Assessment writes an AssignmentMinutesChanged outbox row and marks it published after successful REST;
' this is not evidence of a Kafka publish/consume path, and no event is invented in this read diagram.
' The GET does not inspect assignmentMinutesAsOf or repair/retry an earlier synchronization failure.
' BR-51 settings limitation: only the latest local course_db snapshot is read on each GET.
' The inspected Course PlatformSettings service/controller are empty; seed.ts:106 supplies 200 words/min.
' No automatic live synchronization from central platform settings was verified in this path.
' BR-53: expectedCompletionDays is calendar days; estimatedDurationMinutes is content effort.
' UI renders <60 as minutes, otherwise hours plus remaining minutes, and null as "Not available".
' BR-54/55 gap: schema has studyMinutesPerDay/durationGapThresholdPercent, but findDetail reads neither;
' the page performs no capacity comparison or over-capacity warning. No warning/approval block is invented.
' Cloudinary credential presence selects this provider locally; credential validity is unverified.
' Missing storage configuration would choose UnconfiguredStorageProvider and fail getUrl for a Ready cover.
' Routine DTO, persistence and provider errors are not separate branches; UI clears Course and shows error.
' HttpExceptionFilter returns error instead of top-level message; UI normally uses its generic error text.
' TenantClient/LearningClient are injected into CoursesService but neither is called by findDetail.
' No cross-service HTTP, Kafka, shared database access, content-tree loading or database write in this UC.
@enduml
